## Why This Is Asked
Tests dynamic graph indexing and amortized analysis, combining hub labeling with incremental updates and a concrete cost model.

## Key Concepts
- Hub labeling / two-hop cover
- Incremental updates
- Amortized analysis
- Query-time trade-offs

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode for query
function reachable(S,T,L){
  let best = Infinity;
  for (let h of H[S]) best = Math.min(best, dist(S,h)+dist(h,T));
  for (let h of H[T]) best = Math.min(best, dist(S,h)+dist(h,T));
  return best <= L;
}
```

